      "writtenOn": "2024-03-16T10:11:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since the reboot is triggered at https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/system.c;drc\u003d73528c0fbba08f7b709af48c7fedde698e44cc75;l\u003d1143, which should be already in S5. Tried to add few delays (100ms) before calling into handle_pending_reboot but seems doesn\u0027t help which aligns intel\u0027s recommendation that system should enter G3 to complete the power sequence.",
      "parentUuid": "27a3fa39_77be3bd7",
